# libSceAudioIn - #106, the Surround Studio's AUTO CALIBRATION (MIC).
#
# The user-routed raw PCM capture API; the DualSense microphone arrives through
# it (third_party/ps5-audio-decoding-research/docs/AUDIO-INPUT.md validated the
# capture on hardware). The SDK ships no libSceAudioIn.so, so this is the only
# way the app module can import it. /system/common/lib, not priv/lib.
#
# Every name here becomes an unconditional positional import - keep it to the
# four calls core/src/services/SpeakerCalibrationService.cpp actually makes.
sceAudioInOpen
sceAudioInInput
sceAudioInGetSilentState
sceAudioInClose
